# Meridian

Read `design.md`, then import from `@/lib/design`. Aesthetic: **cinematic design**.

## Frozen (do not invent)

colorRoles · radii · depths · surfaces · themeKnobs · activity · cinematicLaws · banned

## Creative (invent freely)

copy · IA · domain objects · frame sequence · which shadcn wholes · narrative inside one-idea frames

## Hard rules

- Tokens only; one `--brand`; status semantic
- `defineCinemaFrame({ ideas: 1, overlayStickers: false })` for stages
- shadcn primitives only; `data-surface` for density
- `svh` never `dvh`; `edge`/`depth-*` never Tailwind `shadow-*`
- Object-bound AI; no influence-brand labels in UI
- Run `npm run check:design` before done

## Skills

`meridian-theme` · `meridian-surface` · `meridian-compose` · `meridian-cinematic`
